---
// Dark credential bar used on the homepage and About.
---
<section class="statbar">
  <!-- TODO: link the TEDx talk and the books once Eliana sends the URLs -->
  <ul class="wrap stats">
    <li><strong>200+</strong><span>circles, cohorts &amp; workshops held</span></li>
    <li><strong>TEDx</strong><span>speaker</span></li>
    <li><strong>Two books</strong><span>written &amp; published</span></li>
    <li><strong>Monthly</strong><span>journaling mastermind, first Sundays</span></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .statbar { background: var(--espresso); color: var(--cream); padding-block: 1.6rem; }
  .stats {
    list-style: none;
    margin-block: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stats strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-synthesis: none;
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .stats span { display: block; line-height: 1.45; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #cbb99f; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
